│ patch_description        │ The current circuit achieves perfect accuracy but uses 146 parameters with very poor      │
│                          │ parameter efficiency (0.01). The bottleneck is over-parameterization with one unique      │
│                          │ parameter per qubit per rotation layer.                                                   │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Key improvements:                                                                         │
│                          │ 1. **Replace redundant pre/post RZ with shared parameters**: Use only 3 unique parameters │
│                          │ for RZ rotations (one per layer: pre, ising-layer, post), applied to all qubits. This     │
│                          │ reduces RZ parameters from 16 to 3.                                                       │
│                          │ 2. **Replace fixed CZ gates with parametrized XX/YY/ZZ gates**: Use Ising interactions    │
│                          │ with 2 shared parameters (xx_param and yy_param) applied to the chain. This makes the     │
│                          │ two-qubit interactions learnable and more expressive, reducing total parameter count      │
│                          │ while potentially improving generalization.                                               │
│                          │ 3. **Reduce RY uniqueness**: Use only 2 unique RY parameters applied in a pattern, rather │
│                          │ than 8 unique ones.                                                                       │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This should reduce parameters from 146 to roughly 30-40 while maintaining the ability to  │
│                          │ fit the perfect accuracy training set. The shared parameters force the model to learn     │
│                          │ more general, transferable patterns, which should reduce overfitting and improve the test │
│                          │ accuracy stability.                                                                       │
