│                          │ 1. **Current program (score 0.66)**: Uses 26 parameters with RY, RZ_pre, XX interactions, │
│                          │ and RZ_post. The XX gates introduce extra parameters (xx_shared) that don't improve       │
│                          │ accuracy but hurt parameter efficiency.                                                   │
│                          │                                                                                           │
