│                          │ with minimal parameters through parameter sharing.                                        │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 3. **Key insight**: The best performer consolidates all RZ rotations to use a single      │
│                          │ shared parameter, reducing parameter count dramatically while maintaining full accuracy.  │
│                          │ The CZ interactions are sufficient for entanglement without needing parametrized XX       │
│                          │ gates.                                                                                    │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ **Crossover strategy**:                                                                   │
│                          │ - Replace the current program's three separate RZ parameters (rz_pre_shared,              │
│                          │ rz_post_shared) and parametrized XX gates with the best performer's unified "rz_shared"   │
│                          │ parameter applied twice                                                                   │
│                          │ - Keep the RY layer as is (both use identical RY structure)                               │
│                          │ - Replace XX gates with fixed CZ gates (no parameters needed)                             │
│                          │ - This reduces parameters from 26 to 14 while maintaining 100% accuracy and achieving the │
│                          │ best parameter efficiency (0.07)                                                          │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The unified RZ approach leverages maximal parameter sharing while the CZ chain provides   │
│                          │ sufficient qubit connectivity for the task.                                               │
