│                          │ parameter                                                                                 │
│                          │ 3. Maintains the linear RY and CZ chain while adding wrap-around connectivity             │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This should improve parameter efficiency (score component), maintain high accuracy, and   │
│                          │ potentially reduce convergence steps through improved entanglement structure.             │
