│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ alternating_ry_rz_entanglement                                                            │
│ patch_description        │ The current program uses a symmetric structure: all 8 qubits receive identical shared     │
│                          │ rotations (RY, then RZ), followed by a linear CZ chain, followed by another shared RZ     │
│                          │ layer. This achieves perfect accuracy but with high gate depth and parameter count.       │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The redesigned program introduces **alternating qubit groups** with **independent         │
│                          │ parameters** to break symmetry while maintaining parameter economy. Instead of one shared │
│                          │ RY and one shared RZ across all qubits, the new design uses:                              │
│                          │ - Two alternating RY parameters (ry_even, ry_odd) applied to even/odd qubits respectively │
│                          │ - Two alternating RZ parameters (rz_even, rz_odd) applied to even/odd qubits respectively │
│                          │ - The same linear CZ chain for entanglement                                               │
│                          │ - Final RZ sandwich with the alternating pattern                                          │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This reduces the circuit's inherent symmetry, allowing it to capture more expressive      │
│                          │ features with minimal parameter increase (14→18 params), while maintaining depth at 35    │
│                          │ and potentially improving generalization by distributing learned features more adaptively │
│                          │ across qubit pairs. The alternating structure also naturally aligns with nearest-neighbor │
│                          │ entanglement, improving information flow during training.                                 │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
