│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ crz_parametrized_single_block                                                             │
│ patch_description        │ The current program uses 20 parameters split between rz_pre and rz_post, which increased  │
│                          │ parameter count compared to the prior best (14 parameters). The current architecture also │
│                          │ added a circular CZ gate [7,0] that doesn't appear in the simpler, higher-scoring prior   │
│                          │ program.                                                                                  │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This edit restores the parameter-economical single-block structure from Prior Program 2   │
│                          │ (which achieved score 0.72) while upgrading the CZ gates to parametrized CRZ gates with a │
│                          │ shared parameter. This gives the optimizer control over entangling angles without         │
│                          │ inflating parameter count. By replacing 7 fixed CZ gates with 7 CRZ gates sharing one     │
│                          │ parameter, we:                                                                            │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 1. Reduce parameter count from 20 back to 14 (ry_shared + rz_shared + crz_shared)         │
│                          │ 2. Maintain the proven simple linear chain (no circular [7,0] gate)                       │
│                          │ 3. Give the optimizer flexibility to modulate entanglement strength                       │
│                          │ 4. Keep the depth and gate count reasonable while improving expressiveness                │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The parameter economy is preserved (14 params total), and the added expressiveness from   │
│                          │ parametrized CRZ should help match or exceed the prior best score.                        │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0166                                                                                   │
