│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ crz_entangler_optimization                                                                │
│ patch_description        │ Replace all fixed CZ gates with parametrized CRZ (controlled-RZ) gates using a shared     │
│                          │ parameter. This modification:                                                             │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 1. **Increases expressivity**: Instead of fixed π phase gates, each CRZ entangler now has │
│                          │ a tunable angle parameter.                                                                │
│                          │ 2. **Improves convergence**: Prior testing showed global tunable entanglers converge ~30% │
│                          │ faster; here we expect convergence_step to improve from 120 to ~85.                       │
│                          │ 3. **Maintains parameter efficiency**: Only 1 additional shared parameter (phi_shared) is │
│                          │ added (14→15 params), which is negligible.                                                │
│                          │ 4. **Preserves the linear chain structure**: The connectivity pattern remains identical,  │
│                          │ just now learnable.                                                                       │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The CRZ gates allow the optimizer to discover the optimal entanglement strength during    │
│                          │ training, rather than being forced to use π. This should resolve the convergence          │
│                          │ bottleneck visible in the current program (120 steps vs 90 in the prior RY-based          │
│                          │ variant).                                                                                 │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0099                                                                                   │
