│ patch_description        │ Revert to the high-scoring RY-RZ-CZ architecture (0.72 score, 14 params) which            │
│                          │ outperforms the current XX variant (0.68 score, 20 params). The current design adds Ising │
│                          │ gates that increase parameter count without improving accuracy or efficiency.             │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Then add a shared RX initialization layer before the main ansatz, following the expert    │
│                          │ recommendation. This provides a single-axis RX kickstart (1 shared parameter) to          │
│                          │ diversify initial state sampling and potentially improve convergence speed, while         │
│                          │ maintaining minimal parameter overhead.                                                   │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The final gate sequence will be:                                                          │
│                          │ 1. RX initialization (shared across all 8 qubits) - 1 new parameter                       │
│                          │ 2. RY layer (shared) - 1 parameter (reused)                                               │
│                          │ 3. RZ layer (shared) - 1 parameter (reused)                                               │
│                          │ 4. CZ chain (fixed, no params)                                                            │
│                          │ 5. RZ layer (shared) - reuses same parameter                                              │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Total: ~3 parameters, proven architecture, improved initialization.                       │
