│ patch_description        │ This implementation improves upon the current program by implementing the recommended     │
│                          │ alternating entanglement pattern. The key insight is that while maintaining minimal       │
│                          │ parameter count (14), we can vary the direction of CZ entanglement chains across blocks   │
│                          │ to increase quantum state mixing and expressivity without any additional parameters.      │
