│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ restore_shared_params_add_fourth_block                                                    │
│ patch_description        │ The current program split the RZ layers into separate `rz_pre` and `rz_post` parameters   │
│                          │ (3 params total), which decreased the combined score from 0.72 to 0.68. This is because   │
│                          │ parameter efficiency dropped from 0.07 to 0.05 - the model became less economical without │
│                          │ accuracy gains.                                                                           │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The original seed program achieved 0.72 with only 2 shared parameters (ry_shared and      │
│                          │ rz_shared) by reusing them across all 8 qubits. This aggressive parameter sharing         │
│                          │ maximizes the gate-to-parameter ratio and generalization.                                 │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The recommended action is to:                                                             │
│                          │ 1. Revert to 2 shared parameters (ry_shared, rz_shared) as in the seed                    │
│                          │ 2. Add a fourth identical RY→RZ→CZ-chain→RZ block reusing these parameters                │
│                          │ 3. This maintains the proven parameter-efficient structure while increasing depth and     │
│                          │ expressivity                                                                              │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This approach follows the pattern: the second variant kept 2 params with 3 blocks and     │
│                          │ maintained 0.72 score (despite higher depth). Adding a fourth block with the same sharing │
│                          │ strategy should sustain or improve the score while keeping parameter efficiency optimal.  │
