│                          │ ("ry_1"/"rz_1" for block 1, "ry_2"/"rz_2" for block 2). This maintains parameter economy  │
│                          │ (4 total params, one per gate type per block) while allowing each layer to learn distinct │
│                          │ rotation landscapes independently. The high gate-to-parameter ratio (~93 gates per param) │
│                          │ is preserved, and per-block specialization should improve expressiveness and potentially  │
│                          │ accelerate convergence by allowing each layer to adapt to different feature spaces. The   │
│                          │ fixed CZ chain structure maintains connectivity while parameter specialization enables    │
│                          │ richer feature learning.                                                                  │
