│                          │ 3. Current one-block program: score 0.72, n_params 14, convergence at step 90             │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ All achieve the same accuracy with the same parameter count but differ in depth and       │
│                          │ convergence speed. The two-block version converges fastest (step 30), suggesting that     │
│                          │ block repetition helps optimization even with parameter sharing.                          │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The strategy is to add a second block but replace its CZ chain with fixed XX gates. This  │
│                          │ maintains parameter economy (only 2 trainable parameters per original block structure,    │
│                          │ still just 2 total with sharing) while:                                                   │
│                          │ - Testing hybrid entanglement (CZ in first block, XX in second)                           │
│                          │ - Capturing complementary correlations at zero cost                                       │
│                          │ - Potentially improving convergence speed (observed in prior two-block run: step 30 vs    │
│                          │ current 90)                                                                               │
│                          │ - Adding depth for better expressivity without trainable parameter overhead               │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ XX gates are fixed (non-parametrized) diagonal entanglers that preserve the parameter     │
│                          │ count while providing different entanglement topology than CZ.                            │
