│                          │ 1. **Ring topology benefits**: Ring connectivity (closing the linear chain with [7,0])    │
│                          │ provides circular qubit mixing that can enhance global entanglement without adding        │
│                          │ parameters.                                                                               │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 2. **Minimal overhead**: The CZ[7,0] gate is fixed (no parameters), so it maintains the   │
