│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ reverse_forward_cz_zigzag                                                                 │
│ patch_description        │ Prepend a reverse-direction CZ sweep before the forward sweep to implement a              │
│                          │ bidirectional zigzag entanglement pattern. This follows the recommendation and mirrors    │
│                          │ the success of Gen 62's 4-block alternating design but in a more parameter-efficient      │
│                          │ single-block structure.                                                                   │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The reverse sweep [7,6]→[1,0] followed by the forward sweep [0,1]→[6,7] with closure      │
│                          │ creates bidirectional information flow. This should improve gradient flow during training │
│                          │ and reduce convergence steps while maintaining parameter efficiency and accuracy.         │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Evidence from prior programs: Gen 62 (alternating 4-block design) and Gen 66 (ring with   │
│                          │ directed entanglement) both achieved score 0.72 with this type of pattern. The current    │
│                          │ single-block design achieves perfect accuracy but has slow convergence (150 steps).       │
│                          │ Adding the reverse sweep should accelerate this.                                          │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0139                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
│ system_prompt_id         │ None                                                                                      │
│ model_name               │ openrouter/anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5                                                     │
│ temperature              │ 1.0                                                                                       │
│ max_output_tokens        │ 16384                                                                                     │
│ diff_summary             │ added: 9; deleted: 0; modified: 0;                                                        │
